{"kind":"grammar","lang":"en","entities":{"n1-125":{"renderings":[{"id":"84206d9ae9605ebd","role":"prose","field":"shortExplanation","source":{"source":"hanabira","ref":"n1-125"},"match":"id","status":"imported","value":"Emphasizes 'once something happens, there is no going back'; 'once', 'as soon as', etc."},{"id":"729a0fd9bbc72f91","role":"prose","field":"longExplanation","source":{"source":"hanabira","ref":"n1-125"},"match":"id","status":"imported","value":"The 〜たが最後 grammar point indicates that once an action is taken or event occurs, some (often irreversible) consequence follows. In English, it can be translated as 'once', 'as soon as', or 'the moment that...'."},{"id":"1100fdff7ce0cb39","role":"prose","field":"formation","source":{"source":"hanabira","ref":"n1-125"},"match":"id","status":"imported","value":"Verb-casual, past (た form) + が最後"},{"id":"31a528f380afa282","role":"prose","field":"usageNote","source":{"source":"gokan","ref":"n1-125"},"match":"id","status":"reviewed","value":"Very formal, literary - \"once X happens, there's no going back\"; emphasizes irreversibility, not just timing."},{"id":"f993e5eecc2b6f19","role":"label","field":"family","source":{"source":"gokan","ref":"as-soon-as"},"match":"id","status":"reviewed","value":"As Soon As (The Moment That)","of":{"kind":"family","id":"as-soon-as"}}]},"n1-125#d1c9dc0387a8":{"renderings":[{"id":"9fa7fa3bb14e2a55","role":"translation","source":{"source":"hanabira","ref":"n1-125"},"match":"id","status":"imported","value":"Once he gets angry, no one can stop him."}]},"n1-125#f9c30fc238f3":{"renderings":[{"id":"822788f6239401af","role":"translation","source":{"source":"hanabira","ref":"n1-125"},"match":"id","status":"imported","value":"As soon as I started this game, I played it all night."}]},"n1-125#1a323675eee8":{"renderings":[{"id":"fe7c296b27f6f5ba","role":"translation","source":{"source":"hanabira","ref":"n1-125"},"match":"id","status":"imported","value":"The moment she left the room, she never came back."}]},"n1-125#4a2f10c49e1c":{"renderings":[{"id":"65e0ce47f459e03b","role":"translation","source":{"source":"hanabira","ref":"n1-125"},"match":"id","status":"imported","value":"Once I crossed that bridge, it was our final goodbye."}]}}}